WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:04.146
From Río Cuarto and Calamuchita, Team INANNA presents TERRA-SHIFT SCADA.

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:11.525
Live NASA satellites guide resilient crops while our offline ESP32 reads four-to-twenty milliamp root probes.

3
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:19.349
Watch our ESP32 code on a cut wire: current hits zero, NAMUR safety locks the pump, and NASA moisture takes over!

4
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.086
Repaired to twelve milliamps—saving thirty-eight percent of water.

5
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.476
NASA science in orbit, precision at the root!
